+# Storage inventory — Phase A
+
+Static call-site inventory, not a runtime permission matrix. All named stores are covered. The primary ownership rules are in `ownership-matrix.csv` and ADR-001. Multiple source files are always flagged for review; comments, helper definitions and disabled branches can create false candidate writers. Only inspection of the actual branch establishes permission. Registry-only names never prove a live collection. Dynamic references remain D12.
